      "function_role": "tonic-resolution-target",
      "narrative": "Cma9 appears as the tonic resolution target in the major-sounds progression. Ch.2 p.15: 'The fifth chord is G13b5 (or Db7+9b5) which resolves into Cma9.' The major-ninth voicing is the landing point, not a passing color.",
