    {
      "chord_quality": "min7b5",
      "function_role": "ii-chord-in-half-dim-to-dominant-cadence",
      "narrative": "Dm7b5 appears as the ii\u00b0 chord in a ii\u00f8\u2013V7b9 minor cadence and again in a ii\u00f8\u2013V aug context. Ch.2 p.15: 'A7b9 to Dm7b5 resolving finally to G aug' and 'Dm7b5 chords to G aug. Notice the chords used to obtain these sounds.' The half-diminished functions as the ii chord in both cadential sequences.",
